<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1motivation">
<title>Motivation</title><para><linebreak/>
 <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_triple_point_h2_o" kindref="compound">TriplePointH2O</ref> contains the triple point parameters (temperature, pressure) of pure H2O.</para>
