</sect1>
<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1motivation">
<title>Motivation</title><para><linebreak/>
 <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_triple_point_na_cl" kindref="compound">TriplePointNaCl</ref> contains the triple point parameters (temperature, pressure, and composition) of the pure NaCl phase halite, liquid, and vapor at its triple point according to the fits obtained in the paper</para>
<para>Driesner T. and Heinrich C.A. (2007): The system H2O-NaCl. Part I: Correlation formulae for phase relations in temperature-pressure-composition space from 0 to 1000oC, 0 to 5000 bar, and 0 to 1 XNaCl. Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta 71, 4880-4901.</para>
</sect1>
